# An X session on Dolly's display: the Xsdl server, twm managing the
# windows, and three of X's own clients in theirs: a clock, eyes that follow
# the pointer and a terminal with a shell, where imgui-x11 starts Dear ImGui's
# example in a window of its own.
FROM /v0.1.4/Dollyfile-system ed211172d3bda75bf6bd97910d4a0860cce4dc05dbb4394bd0b03a61daf6e7d0
INSTALL /v0.1.4/demos/x11/Dollyfile-xorg-server 3532bb929dc458a78fd8dd0a8e01cfba56254b17d7f66aeb5c77d508f35de423
INSTALL /v0.1.4/demos/x11/Dollyfile-twm 89fe75ca901b429a479e56285d8f2c29892ca877132f165430b616d548fc61d0
INSTALL /v0.1.4/demos/x11/Dollyfile-xclock b2ced698c275ebb26f27dcde950f281a0151c35c70676db68174ed6b1a305d7f
INSTALL /v0.1.4/demos/x11/Dollyfile-xeyes 30140008a7e3f03f5e16079a2acc16ccee362df13a5505ef9747260b4d6276fc
